00 psi hex body</a></th><td class='num'>10,000 psi</td><td>1/4&quot; to 1/2&quot;, 6 to 12 mm</td><td style='white-space:normal'>Female NPT, male NPT or tube ends</td></tr><tr><td>09</td><th scope='row'><a href='<?= BASE ?>ball-valves/heavy-duty-hydraulic-ball-valve'>Heavy-duty hydraulic</a></th><td class='num'>10,000 psi</td><td>1/8&quot; to 1&quot;</td><td style='white-space:normal'>NPT or SAE ports</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
