  <tr><th scope="row">Size</th><td style="white-space:normal">Sixteenths of an inch: 02 = 1/8", 04 = 1/4", 08 = 1/2", 16 = 1". An M prefix means metric tube (M08 = 8 mm OD).</td></tr>
  <tr><th scope="row">Ends</th><td style="white-space:normal">FF = female thread both ends, OD = tube ends</td></tr>
